  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Watershed Approaches for Clima-UNDP-SSD-00122467</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds long term climate resilience among agro-pastoral communities using participatory watershed-based approaches that restore ecosystems and strengthen market linkages and agricultural value chains in Northern Bhar el Ghazal State. It is focused on social safety net approach to incorporate economic model on water shared approach.</narrative>
  </description>
